### Manual
- Open `/works/[slug]` on a throttled 4G connection (Chrome DevTools → Network → Fast 4G)
- Confirm `WatchPlayer` JS chunk loads **only after** clicking "Watch Trailer"
- Confirm `/api/site-settings` response has `Cache-Control` header in Network tab
- Confirm `/api/admin/media` response has updated `max-age` in Network tab
